Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Shopping in the Airport", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can visit different shops in the airport like:<br />  <ul>    \t<li>gift shops </li>  \t<li>clothing stores </li>  \t<li>duty-free shops (These shops sell items you can bring into a country without paying taxes.)</li>  \t</ul><br /><br />  When you are in a shop, you can use these expressions to ask where things are:<br /> <ul>  <span class=\"italic\"><li>I'm looking for \u2026  </li> <li>Do you have any \u2026 ?</li> <li>Where are the \u2026 ? </li> <li>Could you tell me where the \u2026 is?</li> <li>How much \u2026 ?</li></span>  </ul>", "type": "describer"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "in particular ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "used to indicate something specific  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Are you looking for anything in particular?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear when shopping at the airport.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "roller ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a carry on bag which contains wheels ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Where are the rollers?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "duffel bag ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large cloth bag with handles used to carry personal belongings  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Would you like to check your duffel bag? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "swivel ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a device that joins together two parts so that one of the parts can spin ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This roller has swivel wheels. It's great for travel!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "compartment ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a space that is part of something larger and used to hold specific things ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This carry-on has a few compartments to keep your things.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "PIN ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "personal identification number; a secret number you use with your credit or debit card ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Please enter your PIN.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to prompt ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to show a message that tells you to do something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can enter your PIN when the machine prompts you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Asking For Things in a Shop", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Here are some useful questions you can use in a store. Note that some of these questions use the modals  <span class=\"strong\">can</span> and <span class=\"strong\">could</span> to express polite requests, while other use <span class=\"italic\">Simple Present tense</span> in interrogative form.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Can</span> I pay with this card?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Could</span> you tell me where I pay?", "type": "example"}, {"content": " <span class=\"strong\">Do</span> you <span class=\"strong\">have</span> any rollers?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Select an airport.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Visit the airport's website.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find out what shops are in the airport. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down the shops you would like to go to and why.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your list with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify an airport's website.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a list of shops I want to go to and why.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my preferences with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le09ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn3le09ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn3le09ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Clerk</span>: Hello ma'am. Is there anything in particular you're looking for?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm looking for carry-on bags.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Clerk</span>: Rollers? Duffle bags?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Do you have any rollers?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Clerk</span>: Right over here. We have a sale. Which one would you like?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I ripped mine. I just want to buy a new one. I don't want too many compartments.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn3le09ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Clerk</span>: Alright. This one's on sale for $40. It has swivel wheels, a few compartments and comes in a variety of colors. Which color would you like?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I would like the red, please.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Clerk</span>: There you go. Have a great trip.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks. Could you tell me where I pay?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Clerk</span>: Behind the suitcases.", "time": "23000"}, {"image": "engenn3le09ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Cashier</span>: Is this all, ma'am?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes. Can I pay with this card?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Cashier</span>: Of course. Just enter your PIN when prompted.", "time": "48000"}], "coverimg": "engenn3le09ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can talk about air travel. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can ask for things in a store. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can say what I want and would like to do.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you buy things when you are in the airport? What do you buy?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What things do you buy when you are on holiday?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 